{"event":"changes_requested","job_id":"docs-point-of-sale-mobile-android-troubleshooting","reason":"Independently read the complete pinned raw and verified its SHA-256 against the trusted order and receipt. Candidate and suggestions match the receipt; all five quotes are exact at their cited lines. The candidate correctly separates Android Mobile SDK attestation from Android Payments app UI/App Link errors, preserves the NYC1 firmware row, device-bound boarding token, code-specific actions, and unknown financial state after a 05_009 error. Both fixed query answers are supported. One central table contradiction is misstated: the row labeled 03_021 at raw line 85 describes boarding using the code 03_020, not 03_021. This matters when a reader searches an observed 03_021 code and tries to infer its stage or action from the row. The Mobile POS reciprocal route is appropriate."}
